PostKey":"5bd32ad96f7e533104e06a7898a26023","RawContent":"@[member=\"acw271011\"] @[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] \n\n\nKim - I&#039;d love to meet you but unfortunately this Friday won&#039;t work for me. Enjoy your trip to Toronto :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1915140,"PostDate":1470216696,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> <br><br>\nKim - I'd love to meet you but unfortunately this Friday won't work for me. Enjoy your trip to Toronto <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1423090661,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1468890791","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f05980f3060691d79bff559593c9bceb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"] I would love to but I don&#039;t think I can make this Friday! &amp;nbsp;If anything changes I&#039;ll be there&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sorry I&#039;m hardly on here anymore, if I don&#039;t respond please msg me on FB.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915142,"PostDate":1470222522,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> I would love to but I don't think I can make this Friday! \u00a0If anything changes I'll be there\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sorry I'm hardly on here anymore, if I don't respond please msg me on FB.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421428169,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1463440164","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":136,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.142.4.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"20c017e746d6ba0f5f99ae03a6e00cb3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello,\n\n\nI&#039;d also love to but it&#039;s short notice now and I have a weekend full of plans now.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915143,"PostDate":1470223035,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,<br><br>\nI'd also love to but it's short notice now and I have a weekend full of plans now.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pjay","Id":281478,"Name":"pjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.138.111.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"66ee0a4ce1b8541103dc345abb85b355","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I just saw this now. &amp;nbsp;Hope I didn&#039;t miss out =( &amp;nbsp;Hopefully we can meet up sometime this summer. &amp;nbsp;I can&#039;t believe it&#039;s been almost a year since we all met in person for the first time. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915286,"PostDate":1471004743,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just saw this now. \u00a0Hope I didn't miss out =( \u00a0Hopefully we can meet up sometime this summer. \u00a0I can't believe it's been almost a year since we all met in person for the first time. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;484\/st\/20150924\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/8745\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>My Planning Thread:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79153-diadiamonds-planning-thread-iberostar-varadero-cuba-sept242015\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79153-diadiamonds-planning-thread-iberostar-varadero-cuba-sept242015\/<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"fadia.daniel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.64.81.211","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1392649643,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276748.jpg?_r=1445822927","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"diadiamond","Id":276748,"Name":"diadiamond","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.207.201.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd4e1e5696d3b3ab8554b4abf2b1b2a0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies!!!! I&#039;m not sure if anyone remembers me, but I came to the meet up last year. I just wanted to check in with everyone and see how everything went since all of us have tied the knot! So excited to hear from all of you and Congratulations everyone! Sorry for going MIA. I had a really great time with you girls, hoping to do it again one day :) I&#039;m so excited to catch up on everyone&#039;s threads and read reviews.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915287,"PostDate":1471006102,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies!!!! I'm not sure if anyone remembers me, but I came to the meet up last year. I just wanted to check in with everyone and see how everything went since all of us have tied the knot! So excited to hear from all of you and Congratulations everyone! Sorry for going MIA. I had a really great time with you girls, hoping to do it again one day <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm so excited to catch up on everyone's threads and read reviews.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laurena1229@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.68.117.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430933265,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283004.jpg?_r=1471020660","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":128,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Laurena1229","Id":283004,"Name":"Laurena1229","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.215.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"03b68ecd1c9db661533d593af241a5ff","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;any 2017 brides?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915738,"PostDate":1474560674,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>any 2017 brides?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sebejarano@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.215.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1474555186,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287791.jpg?_r=1474569584","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"SamanthaElizabeth","Id":287791,"Name":"SamanthaElizabeth","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":527,"TotalPages":53,"CurrentPage":520,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":510,"LastPage":520},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
