{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":8,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":68,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1915706,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":287765,"Name":"phoenixbride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287765.jpg?_r=1474333958","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1474378118,"LastPoster":{"Id":287765,"Name":"phoenixbride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287765.jpg?_r=1474333958","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1915706,"PostDate":1474378118,"PostContent":"hello beatiful brides! \u00a0 anyone thinking of a destination wedding with no guests?? I've been look...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yazil1304@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.171.71.115","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1474213173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287765.jpg?_r=1474333958","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"phoenixbride","Id":287765,"Name":"phoenixbride","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.94.2.14","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80300,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2773143f307068a9508656fd8675e619","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hello beatiful brides!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;anyone thinking of a destination wedding with no guests?? I&#039;ve been looking at different resorts and pricing, block rates etc...I was overwhelmed &amp;nbsp;lol. So next best idea....no guest. I have a $6000 budget.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915706,"PostDate":1474378118,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>hello beatiful brides!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>anyone thinking of a destination wedding with no guests?? I've been looking at different resorts and pricing, block rates etc...I was overwhelmed \u00a0lol. So next best idea....no guest. I have a $6000 budget.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yazil1304@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.171.71.115","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1474213173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287765.jpg?_r=1474333958","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"phoenixbride","Id":287765,"Name":"phoenixbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.67.9.47","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80300,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1474382519,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c4e5e5fcecbfa9b360e816e6f170c87","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think destination elopements with just the bride and groom are amazing! You can then do completely as you please, catering to only your own needs\/wishes and put money toward a kick ass photographer who can beautifully document your experience. Go for it!!! These types of weddings are becoming more and more popular and they are a photographer&#039;s dream ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915707,"PostDate":1474382488,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think destination elopements with just the bride and groom are amazing! You can then do completely as you please, catering to only your own needs\/wishes and put money toward a kick ass photographer who can beautifully document your experience. Go for it!!! These types of weddings are becoming more and more popular and they are a photographer's dream <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;\"><strong>MARIESAM SANCHEZ PHOTOGRAPHY<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\nWEBSITE: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><br>\nBLOG: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchezblog.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\/blog'>\/blog<\/a><br>\nCONTACT ME: <a  class=\"bbc_email\" href=\"mailto:mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com?subject=BDW%20Inquiry\" title=\"E-mail Link\">mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com<\/a><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\" alt=\"063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\">","Email":"mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1285939945,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80300,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca9f326627fe9343090440e7d78c0533","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;Dear @[member=\"phoenixbride\"]&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;We agree that there are many ways to celebrate a marriage, and certainly a very romantic one is to have an &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff5050;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;intimate celebration&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt; with just bride and groom.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;We\u2019ve had wedding celebrations with the couple only, where we hold their ceremony at a secluded terrace overlooking the sea. The landscape is breathtaking and you can choose a Day or Night celebration on the secluded beach of &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff5050;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;Las Caletas&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;, located at the South bay of Puerto Vallarta Mexico.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;Just imagine sharing your vows with the beautiful &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff5050;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;Pacific Ocean&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt; as a background and surrounded by the vegetation of the Sierra Madre Mountains. Here are some pictures of what we call our &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff5050;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;Barefoot Wedding&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:84734]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83501]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:84558]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83506]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83503]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;For more information please go to our website: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#5959ff;\"&gt;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915709,"PostDate":1474393341,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\">Dear @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287765\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287765-phoenixbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">phoenixbride<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\">We agree that there are many ways to celebrate a marriage, and certainly a very romantic one is to have an <\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"color:#ff5050\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\">intimate celebration<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"> with just bride and groom.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\">We\u2019ve had wedding celebrations with the couple only, where we hold their ceremony at a secluded terrace overlooking the sea. The landscape is breathtaking and you can choose a Day or Night celebration on the secluded beach of <\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"color:#ff5050\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\">Las Caletas<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\">, located at the South bay of Puerto Vallarta Mexico.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\">Just imagine sharing your vows with the beautiful <\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"color:#ff5050\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\">Pacific Ocean<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"> as a background and surrounded by the vegetation of the Sierra Madre Mountains. Here are some pictures of what we call our <\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"color:#ff5050\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\">Barefoot Wedding<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong>:<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/84734-table-for-two\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18165\/sml_gallery_258213_18165_746857.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='table for two'  width='200' height='134'  alt='table for two' id='sml_image_view_84734' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83501-barefoot-wedding-package-ceremony\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18165\/sml_gallery_258213_18165_1378678.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Barefoot wedding package (Ceremony)'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Barefoot wedding package (Ceremony)' id='sml_image_view_83501' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/84558-tropical-ceremony-set-up-in-a-special-and-private-area-our-ceremony-set-up-is-ready\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_437023.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Tropical ceremony set up- In a special and private area, our ceremony set up is ready...'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Tropical ceremony set up- In a special and private area, our ceremony set up is ready...' id='sml_image_view_84558' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83506-vow-renewals-and-annviersary-at-las-caletas\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18165\/sml_gallery_258213_18165_1250009.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Vow Renewals and Annviersary at Las Caletas'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Vow Renewals and Annviersary at Las Caletas' id='sml_image_view_83506' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83503-destination-wedding-las-caletas-puerto-vallarta\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18165\/sml_gallery_258213_18165_1418248.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Destination wedding, Las Caletas Puerto Vallarta'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Destination wedding, Las Caletas Puerto Vallarta' id='sml_image_view_83503' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\">For more information please go to our website: <a href='http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#5959ff\">http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343044403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.36.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80300,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5cb375a6622ec6d113feb208004de5db","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community phoenixbride and Congrats on your destination wedding plans!!! So Exciting - YES! We&#039;ve captured elopements with only the bride and groom - or sometimes with 2 other guests, and they&#039;ve been Amazing!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are some visuals to show you what we&#039;re talking about, and how much fun they had....enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2012\/7\/11\/Le-Blanc-Resort-The-White-Wedding-TTD&#039;&gt;Le Blanc Wedding Story Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_01f074c0ffab40a0abb5af427b1eef36.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_01f074c0ffab40a0abb5af427b1eef36.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_01f074c0ffab40a0abb5af427b1eef36.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Taken from &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2015\/02\/21\/Moon-Palace-Wedding&#039;&gt;Moon Palace Wedding Story Album &lt;\/a&gt;with 4 people:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_3c64b3973fe84bc1b398e228d104bd02.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_3c64b3973fe84bc1b398e228d104bd02.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_3c64b3973fe84bc1b398e228d104bd02.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_6cf5006c8d214a0f99d88f994696716a.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_6cf5006c8d214a0f99d88f994696716a.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_6cf5006c8d214a0f99d88f994696716a.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research and a wonderful life journey ahead - Enjoy!!! cheers, Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915713,"PostDate":1474455254,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community phoenixbride and Congrats on your destination wedding plans!!! So Exciting - YES! We've captured elopements with only the bride and groom - or sometimes with 2 other guests, and they've been Amazing!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are some visuals to show you what we're talking about, and how much fun they had....enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2012\/7\/11\/Le-Blanc-Resort-The-White-Wedding-TTD' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Le Blanc Wedding Story Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_01f074c0ffab40a0abb5af427b1eef36.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_01f074c0ffab40a0abb5af427b1eef36.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_01f074c0ffab40a0abb5af427b1eef36.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Taken from <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2015\/02\/21\/Moon-Palace-Wedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Moon Palace Wedding Story Album <\/a>with 4 people:<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_3c64b3973fe84bc1b398e228d104bd02.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_3c64b3973fe84bc1b398e228d104bd02.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_3c64b3973fe84bc1b398e228d104bd02.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_6cf5006c8d214a0f99d88f994696716a.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_6cf5006c8d214a0f99d88f994696716a.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_6cf5006c8d214a0f99d88f994696716a.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research and a wonderful life journey ahead - Enjoy!!! cheers, Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.94.2.14","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80300,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d203201f506cfed9b117b9f8bc385fb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"LasCaletas\"] is there an option for a mayan ceremony? thank you for your response.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915715,"PostDate":1474469421,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"258213\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/258213-lascaletas\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LasCaletas<\/span><\/a> is there an option for a mayan ceremony? thank you for your response.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yazil1304@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.171.71.115","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1474213173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287765.jpg?_r=1474333958","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"phoenixbride","Id":287765,"Name":"phoenixbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.25.17.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80300,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc1fd011aee71dfb699c6fe5185a9408","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Isn&#039;t it super annoying that your 1st 3 responses are from wedding vendors and not real DW brides? That drives me nuts!! They should really have some rules around that.........anyways.......&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am doing just bride and groom (and daughter) as the resort we ended up picking was too expensive for any of the people we would&#039;ve invited.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are also having a reception at home when we get back, I think that will satisfy everyone.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let me know if you have any questions about how we are doing it :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915716,"PostDate":1474472654,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Isn't it super annoying that your 1st 3 responses are from wedding vendors and not real DW brides? That drives me nuts!! They should really have some rules around that.........anyways.......<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am doing just bride and groom (and daughter) as the resort we ended up picking was too expensive for any of the people we would've invited.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are also having a reception at home when we get back, I think that will satisfy everyone.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know if you have any questions about how we are doing it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hmfreeman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.25.17.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1447939411,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"hmsm","Id":285386,"Name":"hmsm","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.153.59.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80300,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6aea1cb2e042875f3f4ab5dfae15b0fc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"phoenixbride\"] Congratulations on your upcoming wedding. Feb 2018 will be here before you know it!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you&#039;re looking for a Mayan Ceremony we&#039;ve worked with a wonderful officiant company in the past who offer just that. Their names are &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/rivieramayaofficiant.com\/&#039;&gt;Anna &amp;amp; Anastasia from Riviera Maya Officiant&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you do end up contacting them let them know Jasmin &amp;amp; Matt sent you their way &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;When it comes time to book a photographer give us a shout.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915717,"PostDate":1474472897,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287765\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287765-phoenixbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">phoenixbride<\/span><\/a> Congratulations on your upcoming wedding. Feb 2018 will be here before you know it!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you're looking for a Mayan Ceremony we've worked with a wonderful officiant company in the past who offer just that. Their names are <a href='http:\/\/rivieramayaofficiant.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Anna & Anastasia from Riviera Maya Officiant<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you do end up contacting them let them know Jasmin & Matt sent you their way <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>When it comes time to book a photographer give us a shout.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1915717]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2016\/post-287055-0-47533400-1474487215.jpg\" title=\"Maribel_Leo_Teaser_13.jpg - Size: 94KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2016\/post-287055-0-47533400-1474487215.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Maribel_Leo_Teaser_13.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1915717]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2016\/post-287055-0-02371600-1474487257.jpg\" title=\"Kristi_Gord_Teaser_03.jpg - Size: 101.24KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2016\/post-287055-0-02371600-1474487257.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Kristi_Gord_Teaser_03.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1915717]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2016\/post-287055-0-36927100-1474487268.jpg\" title=\"Jannet_Evan_Teaser_01.jpg - Size: 97.63KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2016\/post-287055-0-36927100-1474487268.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Jannet_Evan_Teaser_01.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1915717]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2016\/post-287055-0-68401400-1474487283.jpg\" title=\"Annie_Phil_Teaser_17.jpg - Size: 76.59KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2016\/post-287055-0-68401400-1474487283.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Annie_Phil_Teaser_17.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Jasmin & Matt - Breathtaking Destination Wedding & Lifestyle Photography<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\">\u00a0rating on <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Facebook<\/a> & <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21784-jasmin-matt-photogr